<title>USA: Envirotest to buy MARTA's emissions tests.</title>
<headline>Envirotest to buy MARTA's emissions tests.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Envirotest Systems Corp said Monday it agreed to buy the centralized emissions-testing programs of MARTA Technologies Inc, a subsidiary of the Allen Group Inc of Beachwood, Ohio.</p>
<p>The purchase agreement covers MARTA's operating programs in the state of Maryland, Jacksonville, Fla., and Cincinnati. It is subject to completion of due diligence and board approvals.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk, 212-603-3310</p>
</text>
